⍝ lib/term.imo — spec notation — trusted prelude, part 26: terms: variables, numbers and applications, with equality, a total order, substitution and matching
⍝ A term is a Scott value with three constructors:  tvar n (a variable; n is the code of its name), tnum q (a number q ∈ ℚ[i]) and
⍝ tapp f xs (the symbol f applied to the list xs; f is the code of its name: a symbol is a string of digits, written back with symname).
⍝ Take a term apart with  (t (n ↦ if-variable) (f xs ↦ if-application) (q ↦ if-number)).  The terms of a theory (lib/theory.imo) are these.
Term ∶ 𝒦
(↗ 𝔏)
tvar ∶ ℕ → Term      ⍝ the variable with this index
tvar ξ η ζ ω ≔ (η ξ)
tapp ∶ ℕ → 𝔏 Term → Term      ⍝ the symbol f applied to arguments
tapp ξ η ζ ω ν ≔ (ω ξ η)
tnum ∶ ℚ[i] → Term      ⍝ a number
tnum ξ η ζ ω ≔ (ω ξ)
tconst ∶ ℕ → Term      ⍝ a symbol without arguments
tconst ξ ≔ (tapp ξ ⊘)
tapp₁ ∶ ℕ → Term → Term
tapp₁ ξ η ≔ (tapp ξ (∷ η ⊘))
tapp₂ ∶ ℕ → Term → Term → Term
tapp₂ ξ η ζ ≔ (tapp ξ (∷ η (∷ ζ ⊘)))
tisvar ∶ Term → 𝔹
tisvar ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ ⊤) (η ζ ↦ ⊥) (η ↦ ⊥))
tisapp ∶ Term → 𝔹
tisapp ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ ⊥) (η ζ ↦ ⊤) (η ↦ ⊥))
tisnum ∶ Term → 𝔹
tisnum ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ ⊥) (η ζ ↦ ⊥) (η ↦ ⊤))
thead ∶ Term → ℕ      ⍝ the symbol of an application (0 for the others)
thead ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ 0) (η ζ ↦ η) (η ↦ 0))
targs ∶ Term → 𝔏 Term      ⍝ the arguments of an application (none for the others)
targs ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ ⊘) (η ζ ↦ ζ) (η ↦ ⊘))
tisconst ∶ ℕ → Term → 𝔹      ⍝ is the term this symbol without arguments
tisconst ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ↦ ⊥) (ζ ω ↦ (∧ (≐ ζ ξ) (∅ ω))) (ζ ↦ ⊥))
tishead ∶ ℕ → Term → 𝔹      ⍝ is the term an application of this symbol
tishead ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ↦ ⊥) (ζ ω ↦ (≐ ζ ξ)) (ζ ↦ ⊥))
tnumval ∶ Term → ℚ[i]
tnumval ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ 0) (η ζ ↦ 0) (η ↦ η))
⍝ ---- equality and order
teq ∶ Term → Term → 𝔹      ⍝ the same term
teq ξ η ≔ (ξ (ζ ↦ (η (ω ↦ (≐ ζ ω)) (ω ν ↦ ⊥) (ω ↦ ⊥))) (ζ ω ↦ (η (ν ↦ ⊥) (ν ο ↦ (∧ (≐ ζ ν) (teql ω ο))) (ν ↦ ⊥))) (ζ ↦ (η (ω ↦ ⊥) (ω ν ↦ ⊥) (ω ↦ (≐ ζ ω)))))
teql ∶ 𝔏 Term → 𝔏 Term → 𝔹
teql ξ η ≔ (ξ (θ ι ↦ (η (κ′ μ ↦ (∧ (teq θ κ′) (teql ι μ))) ⊥)) (∅ η))
qlt ∶ ℚ[i] → ℚ[i] → 𝔹      ⍝ the order on ℚ[i]: real part, then imaginary part
qlt ξ η ≔ (∨ (≺ (ℜ ξ) (ℜ η)) (∧ (≐ (ℜ ξ) (ℜ η)) (≺ (ℑ ξ) (ℑ η))))
idlt ∶ ℚ[i] → ℚ[i] → 𝔹      ⍝ the order on symbols: by their codes, digit by digit
idlt ξ η ≔ (dlt (◀ ξ) (◀ η))
dlt ∶ 𝔇 → 𝔇 → 𝔹
dlt ξ η ≔ (ξ (θ ι ↦ (η (κ′ μ ↦ ((⊻ θ κ′) κ′ (dlt ι μ))) ⊥)) (∃ₗ (θ ↦ θ) η))
tlt ∶ Term → Term → 𝔹      ⍝ a total order on terms: numbers, then variables, then applications (by symbol, then argument by argument; a shorter list first)
tlt ξ η ≔ (ξ (ζ ↦ (η (ω ↦ (idlt ζ ω)) (ω ν ↦ ⊤) (ω ↦ ⊥))) (ζ ω ↦ (η (ν ↦ ⊥) (ν ο ↦ ((≐ ζ ν) (tltl ω ο) (idlt ζ ν))) (ν ↦ ⊥))) (ζ ↦ (η (ω ↦ ⊤) (ω ν ↦ ⊤) (ω ↦ (qlt ζ ω)))))
tltl ∶ 𝔏 Term → 𝔏 Term → 𝔹
tltl ξ η ≔ (ξ (θ ι ↦ (η (κ′ μ ↦ ((tlt θ κ′) ⊤ ((tlt κ′ θ) ⊥ (tltl ι μ)))) ⊥)) (¬ (∅ η)))
tle ∶ Term → Term → 𝔹
tle ξ η ≔ (¬ (tlt η ξ))
tsort ∶ 𝔏 Term → 𝔏 Term      ⍝ sorted by tlt
tsort ξ ≔ (sortby tle ξ)
⍝ the sorted list without repetitions
tnub ∶ 𝔏 Term → 𝔏 Term
tnub ξ ≔ (ξ (θ ι ↦ (∷ θ (tnub (dropwhile (κ′ ↦ (teq θ κ′)) ι)))) ⊘)
⍝ ---- shape
tsize ∶ Term → ℕ      ⍝ the number of nodes
tsize ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ 1) (η ζ ↦ (⊞ 1 (sumof (⫶ tsize ζ)))) (η ↦ 1))
tvars ∶ Term → 𝔏 ℕ      ⍝ the variables, each once, in order of first occurrence
tvars ξ ≔ (nubby ≐ (tvars′ ξ))
tvars′ ∶ Term → 𝔏 ℕ
tvars′ ξ ≔ (ξ (η ↦ (∷ η ⊘)) (η ζ ↦ (concatmap tvars′ ζ)) (η ↦ ⊘))
tground ∶ Term → 𝔹      ⍝ without variables
tground ξ ≔ (∅ (tvars′ ξ))
⍝ ---- substitution and matching.  A substitution is a Dict Term from variable to term
tsubst ∶ Dict Term → Term → Term      ⍝ replace the variables that the substitution binds
tsubst ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ↦ ((ω ↦ ((∅ ω) η (hd ω))) (dkget (◀ ζ) ξ))) (ζ ω ↦ (tapp ζ (⫶ (tsubst ξ) ω))) (ζ ↦ η))
tmatch ∶ Term → Term → Dict Term → 𝔏 (Dict Term)      ⍝ match the pattern against the term, extending the substitution: [σ] or []
tmatch ξ η ζ ≔ (ξ (ω ↦ ((ν ↦ ((∅ ν) (∷ (dkput (◀ ω) η ζ) ⊘) ((teq (hd ν) η) (∷ ζ ⊘) ⊘))) (dkget (◀ ω) ζ))) (ω ν ↦ (η (ο ↦ ⊘) (ο ρ ↦ ((∧ (≐ ω ο) (≐ (ℓ ν) (ℓ ρ))) (tmatchl ν ρ ζ) ⊘)) (ο ↦ ⊘))) (ω ↦ (η (ν ↦ ⊘) (ν ο ↦ ⊘) (ν ↦ ((≐ ω ν) (∷ ζ ⊘) ⊘)))))
tmatchl ∶ 𝔏 Term → 𝔏 Term → Dict Term → 𝔏 (Dict Term)
tmatchl ξ η ζ ≔ (ξ (θ ι ↦ (η (κ′ μ ↦ ((ν ↦ ((∅ ν) ⊘ (tmatchl ι μ (hd ν)))) (tmatch θ κ′ ζ))) ⊘)) (∷ ζ ⊘))
⍝ the term with a function applied to each argument (and the head and numbers kept)
tmapargs ∶ (Term → Term) → Term → Term
tmapargs ξ η ≔ (η (ζ ↦ η) (ζ ω ↦ (tapp ζ (⫶ ξ ω))) (ζ ↦ η))
⍝ symbols are the codes of their names
symid ∶ 𝕊 → ℕ      ⍝ the symbol (or variable) of a name: the code of the name (lib/dict.imo) read as a number, so that no arithmetic is done to make it
symid ξ ≔ (⊗ (skey ξ) (◀ 1))
symname ∶ ℕ → 𝕊      ⍝ the name of a symbol
symname ξ ≔ (unskey (◀ ξ))
